{"id": "case-01", "request": "四种方法在三个 benchmark 上的成功率，突出我们的方法，单栏，不要柱上数字", "recipe": "ours-vs-baselines", "data": "examples/templates/ours-vs-baselines/data.csv", "expect": {"chart": "grouped-bar", "size": "single", "emphasis": ["focus-gray"], "labels": {"values": false, "legend": "top"}}}
{"id": "case-02", "request": "三个任务比较改动前后两个版本，单栏，用箭头标出每组差值", "recipe": "before-after", "data": "examples/templates/before-after/data.csv", "expect": {"layout": "paired", "size": "single", "annotations": ["delta", "delta", "delta"], "emphasis": []}}
{"id": "case-03", "request": "总共九十六项完成八十八项，画实心完成量和空心总量，单栏", "recipe": "capacity-88-of-96", "data": "examples/templates/capacity-88-of-96/data.csv", "expect": {"size": "single", "encoding_cards": ["capacity"], "encoding": {"capacity": "capacity"}, "labels": {"values": false}}}
{"id": "case-04", "request": "五个消融设置在三个任务上比较，双栏，图例放顶部", "recipe": "ablation-legend", "data": "examples/templates/ablation-legend/data.csv", "expect": {"size": "double", "labels": {"legend": "top", "values": false}, "layout": "grouped"}}
{"id": "case-05", "request": "四类动作的成功比例用横向柱图，数值和轴都用百分比，单栏", "recipe": "horizontal-percent", "data": "examples/templates/horizontal-percent/data.csv", "expect": {"layout": "horizontal", "size": "single", "labels": {"values": true, "value_format": ".0%"}, "axis": {"y_format": ".0%"}}}
{"id": "case-06", "request": "图要黑白打印，三种方法用灰度和纹理区分，单栏", "recipe": "print-bw", "data": "examples/templates/print-bw/data.csv", "expect": {"size": "single", "theme": {"palette": "grayscale", "hatch": true}, "emphasis": []}}
{"id": "case-07", "request": "两个环境各三个方法，纵向分成两面板，保持单栏宽度并突出 Ours", "recipe": "multi-panel", "data": "examples/templates/multi-panel/data.csv", "expect": {"size": "single", "encoding": {"panel": "panel"}, "emphasis": ["focus-gray"]}}
{"id": "case-08", "request": "演示用的四方法三基准对比，双栏宽度，放大字号并突出我们的方法", "recipe": "slide-teaser", "data": "examples/templates/slide-teaser/data.csv", "expect": {"size": "double", "theme": {"type_scale": 1.5}, "emphasis": ["focus-gray"]}}
{"id": "case-09", "request": "用中性灰衬托 Ours，在 Bench B 标注相对 Method 1 的百分点提升", "recipe": "ours-vs-baselines", "data": "examples/templates/ours-vs-baselines/data.csv", "expect": {"theme": {"palette": "neutral-accent"}, "annotations": ["delta"], "series_order": ["method-1", "method-2", "method-3", "ours"]}}
{"id": "case-10", "request": "完成数量与总量对比，不把总量画成第二个方法，不显示普通柱上数字", "recipe": "capacity-88-of-96", "data": "examples/templates/capacity-88-of-96/data.csv", "expect": {"encoding_cards": ["capacity"], "series_order": ["achieved"], "labels": {"values": false, "legend": "none"}}}
{"id": "case-11", "request": "论文单栏图，不标柱上数值，顶部图例和纹理要对应", "recipe": "print-bw", "data": "examples/templates/print-bw/data.csv", "expect": {"size": "single", "theme": {"hatch": true}, "labels": {"values": false, "legend": "top"}}}
{"id": "case-12", "request": "五个消融设置的双栏论文图，同时导出 PNG、PDF 和可编辑文字 SVG", "recipe": "ablation-legend", "data": "examples/templates/ablation-legend/data.csv", "expect": {"size": "double", "output": {"formats": ["png", "pdf", "svg"], "svg_text": true}}}
{"id": "case-13", "request": "三年任务成功率，用 hatched 基数加实色增量表示今年基数和下一年增长，单栏", "recipe": "increment-base", "data": "examples/templates/increment-base/data.csv", "expect": {"encoding_cards": ["increment"], "encoding": {"base": "base"}, "layout": "grouped", "labels": {"values": false, "legend": "none"}}}
{"id": "case-14", "request": "两个 setting 下比较 Correct/Incorrect 的 confidence 分布，双栏，看 overlap", "recipe": "distribution-overlap", "data": "examples/templates/distribution-overlap/data.csv", "expect": {"encoding_cards": ["distribution"], "chart": "distribution-overlap", "labels": {"legend": "top"}}}
{"id": "case-15", "request": "四种方法在三个 benchmark 上用 dot plot 对比，单栏，顶部图例", "recipe": "dot-plot", "data": "examples/templates/dot-plot/data.csv", "expect": {"chart": "dot-plot", "labels": {"legend": "top"}}}
{"id": "case-16", "request": "三个任务改动前后用 dumbbell 对比，标出差值，单栏", "recipe": "dumbbell", "data": "examples/templates/dumbbell/data.csv", "expect": {"chart": "dumbbell", "labels": {"legend": "top"}}}
{"id": "case-17", "request": "训练曲线两个方法，带 95% 区间和 SOTA 参考线，单栏", "recipe": "line-band", "data": "examples/templates/line-band/data.csv", "expect": {"chart": "line-band", "stats": [{"kind": "ci-band"}], "reference": [{"axis": "y", "value": 75, "label": "SOTA"}]}}
{"id": "case-18", "request": "latency-throughput 散点，两个方法带线性趋势和置信椭圆，单栏", "recipe": "scatter", "data": "examples/templates/scatter/data.csv", "expect": {"chart": "scatter", "stats": [{"kind": "trend", "method": "linear"}, {"kind": "confidence-ellipse", "level": 0.95}], "reference": [{"axis": "y", "value": 80, "label": "target"}]}}
{"id": "case-19", "request": "两个方法在三个 benchmark 上的 latency 分布，用 box 看中位数和 IQR", "recipe": "box", "data": "examples/templates/box/data.csv", "expect": {"chart": "box", "reference": [{"axis": "y", "value": 90, "label": "target"}]}}
{"id": "case-20", "request": "两个方法在三个 benchmark 上的 latency 分布形状，用 violin", "recipe": "violin", "data": "examples/templates/violin/data.csv", "expect": {"chart": "violin", "reference": [{"axis": "y", "value": 90, "label": "target"}]}}
{"id": "case-21", "request": "两个方法的 latency ECDF，比较尾部，单栏", "recipe": "ecdf", "data": "examples/templates/ecdf/data.csv", "expect": {"chart": "ecdf"}}
{"id": "case-22", "request": "两个方法的 confidence KDE，比较 overlap，单栏", "recipe": "kde", "data": "examples/templates/kde/data.csv", "expect": {"chart": "kde"}}
{"id": "case-23", "request": "四层五任务的指标矩阵，用 heatmap 并标 cell 数值", "recipe": "heatmap", "data": "examples/templates/heatmap/data.csv", "expect": {"chart": "heatmap", "labels": {"values": true, "legend": "none"}}}
{"id": "case-24", "request": "二分类 ROC，带 AUC 图例，单栏", "recipe": "roc", "data": "examples/templates/roc/data.csv", "expect": {"chart": "roc"}}
{"id": "case-25", "request": "不平衡二分类的 precision-recall，单栏", "recipe": "pr", "data": "examples/templates/pr/data.csv", "expect": {"chart": "pr"}}
{"id": "case-26", "request": "二分类置信度校准曲线，单栏", "recipe": "calibration", "data": "examples/templates/calibration/data.csv", "expect": {"chart": "calibration"}}
